      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "If the team works remotely, it will need a clear schedule. Leah therefore arranged a trial rather than making a permanent promise. If everyone worked different hours, meetings would be difficult to organise. She asked each employee to explain which tasks required collaboration and which could be done independently.",
        "zh": "如果团队远程工作，就需要明确的时间安排。因此，利娅安排了一次试行，而没有作出永久承诺。如果每个人的工作时间都不同，会议就会很难安排。她请每位员工说明哪些任务需要合作，哪些可以独立完成。",
