      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "After six weeks, productivity had improved on some tasks, but the workload was not shared equally. One colleague felt isolated, while another enjoyed avoiding the daily journey. Their supervisor introduced a short morning meeting and a weekly mentoring session. The team began to judge progress by results rather than time online.",
        "zh": "六周后，有些任务的生产效率提高了，但工作量分配不均。一位同事觉得孤单，另一位则很高兴不用每天通勤。主管安排了简短晨会和每周一次的指导交流。团队开始根据结果，而不是在线时长，判断进展。",
        "start": 102.64666666666666,
        "voiceEnd": 130.95999999999998,
        "end": 159.2733333333333,
